    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "92E18DBC67B6A80F",
      "text": "어째서!?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "92E18EBC67B6A9C2",
      "text": "싫어진 거야?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "50B90C7098D3DAF0",
      "text": "아니, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] 때문이라든지\\n리그가 싫어져서 그런 건 아니야.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "50B90F7098D3E009",
      "text": "나, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]처럼\\n강해지고 싶어서... 강해지려다 보니\\r\\n지금까지 승부가 재밌다는 걸 잊고 있었어.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "50B90E7098D3DE56",
      "text": "그래서 당분간은\\n나 자신을 돌아보는 시간을 가지려고.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "50B9117098D3E36F",
      "text": "친구도 포켓몬도\\n있는 그대로의 모습으로 대해 볼 생각이야.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "92E18FBC67B6AB75",
      "text": "멋진 이유네!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "92E188BC67B69F90",
      "text": "응원할게!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "50B9107098D3E1BC",
      "text": "...응! 고마워.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "50B9137098D3E6D5",
      "text": "나를 빼면 사천왕 이상으로는\\n바뀌는 사람이 없게 될 거야.\\r\\n하솔도 강등되지 않게 됐으니 다행이고.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_07",
      "hash64": "50B9127098D3E522",
      "text": "그렇지만, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\n아직 방심하면 안 돼![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_08",
      "hash64": "50B9157098D3EA3B",
      "text": "마음의 정리가 되면\\n다시 챔피언을 노리러 갈 테니까![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
